          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>SodaPeak is a supplement designed for adult male vitality and intended to improve their energy, stamina, endurance and overall well-being. It comes in a unique gummy form which makes it more convenient than other types of supplements. The function of this supplement is to assist the natural process of the body and provide additional benefits for a dynamic lifestyle. Adult men who have an intense schedule at work or are very active in other aspects of their lives could find this product useful because of its unique form. However, one should keep in mind that supplements do not always affect people equally.</div><div><br></div><div>The first reason why SodaPeak has gained popularity is that it is dedicated to the male daily energy. There are many factors that could affect one's energy and stamina. These factors include food intake, physical activities, stress, sleep, and overall health. SodaPeak is positioned as one more element in the list of ways to improve one's wellbeing. SodaPeak does not claim to substitute a normal way of life; it should be used as another part of daily routine. Furthermore, its gummy formula eliminates the need to measure powder or drink anything.</div><div><br></div><div>Furthermore, SodaPeak is also designed for individuals who would like to ensure endurance of their bodies and have an active life style. The daily duties, workouts, and other activities impose various demands on one’s body. Therefore, proper nutrition and sufficient rest are necessary to ensure that the person is capable of exhibiting natural physical performance. SodaPeak is advertised by taking into account these goals of wellbeing, namely its impact on energy, stamina, and vigor. However, its primary function is not related to performance; it is aimed at providing nutritional support. Hence, people should expect realistic results from using this product since no supplements can promise enhancement in physical strength, endurance, self-confidence, and sexual performance.</div><div><br></div><div>Yet another characteristic of SodaPeak is the fact that it is a simple gummy. Some individuals find taking regular capsule form to be difficult, especially in cases where an individual takes many supplements per day. Taking the gummy form is an easier option because there is no need to measure or shake the contents into a shaker bottle. Therefore, SodaPeak could be the right choice for those adults looking for easy-to-take wellness products. While following a consistent schedule helps one remember to take their supplements every day, consistency does not ensure results. Potential customers should check the label and other information before buying the product.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>As a general rule, the product is advertised as a simple dietary supplement for men that promotes energy, endurance, and vigor in daily life. It can become an option for mature men who desire to improve their quality of life with the help of proper nutrition. Nevertheless, it is necessary to remember that there is a difference between the promotion of a product and its impact on health confirmed by clinical studies. The product is not intended to cure such diseases as erectile dysfunction, hormonal problems, fatigue, etc. Therefore, in case any changes appear in these areas, men are advised to consult doctors.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
