          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>The SodaPeak formula is made to work along with other nutritional routines using the easy-to-consume form of a gummy supplement. Following consumption, the contents pass through the process of digestion where nutrients can be assimilated and used by the body based on their specific properties. The formula is advertised to aid with maintaining healthy levels of energy, endurance, and male health. The goal of the formula is not to act as a stimulant but provide slow and steady nutrition.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>Factors that affect energy levels include diet, sleep, water consumption, and exercise. SodaPeak is marketed as a supplement that may be used by men in need of further energy assistance in their lives and active lifestyles. The nutritional purpose of the product is to assist the body with its natural energy processes. It should not, however, be seen as a foolproof remedy to fatigue. Adequate sleep, proper nutrition, and exercise will still play their important roles in energy maintenance.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>Having physical endurance plays a role in accomplishing one's duties as well as participating in physical activities. SodaPeak is a product targeted at improving the endurance of men through a wellness strategy. The botanical and nutritional marketing of this supplement is expected to work together with the natural processes of the body. Nevertheless, individual reactions to such supplements may differ, hence, there is no assurance that consumption of this product will lead to enhanced performance during physical activities.</div><div><br></div><div>Male vitality consists of a few elements related to general health, such as exercise, proper nutrition, emotional well-being, and healthy living. SodaPeak has been designed as a daily supplement for those who want to enhance their general vitality. The ease of using the gummies makes it easy to add to a healthy lifestyle. However, while the use of the supplement is helpful, it is essential to pay attention to the development of healthy habits and proper health care. The supplement is not a cure for any conditions.</div><div><br></div><div>Consistency plays an important role in leading a healthy life. SodaPeak provides the option of gummy formulation that might make the process of taking supplements easy for people who do not prefer conventional methods of capsules and powder. Taking a supplement following the directions on the packaging will make it easier to develop a consistent routine. However, consistency does not always guarantee success, as overdosing will not make it more effective than the recommended dose.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
