        {
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Everyday Energy:</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Among the main advertised advantages of SodaPeak is the provision of energy and vitality for daily use. Having energy during the entire day makes it easy to handle daily tasks, exercises, and other personal commitments. SodaPeak is made to go well with a healthy way of life for those men who need extra nutrition. It is not an immediate source of energy nor a magic cure for feeling tired. Healthy nutrition, sleep, and activity still matter for having normal energy.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Promotes Stamina and Endurance Support:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;SodaPeak is designed for males who wish to improve their stamina and endurance while performing day-to-day tasks. Endurance is an essential factor when it comes to working out, enjoying leisure time activities, and having a hectic schedule. SodaPeak is meant to help the natural functions of the body rather than be a substitute for the proper training and nutrition routine. People must have reasonable expectations and should bear in mind that physical improvement can be achieved by many means.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Overall Male Vitality: </b>Male vigour consists of being physically fit, having energy on a daily basis, healthy living, and self-confidence. SodaPeak is portrayed as an easy-to-use supplement for adult men who are keen on sustaining such elements of health. The fact that it comes in daily gummies makes it an easy supplement to introduce into one’s existing regimen. It does not in any way imply that it can act as hormone therapy or as a cure for aging problems.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Convenient Daily Supplementation: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Another great advantage of SodaPeak is the fact that it comes in the form of gummies. Some people prefer taking gummies rather than pills because they can be more convenient and less hassle, particularly for those who are busy. The simple formulation means there is no need for you to mix any powders or concoct any beverages. However, you must always adhere to the dose guidelines indicated on your own bottle.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Complements an Active Lifestyle:</b>&nbsp;Maintaining an active lifestyle requires attention to exercise, nutrition, hydration, and recovery. SodaPeak is marketed as an additional wellness product for men who want to complement these habits with daily nutritional support. It may fit into routines that include walking, strength training, recreational sports, or other physical activities. However, a supplement cannot replace consistent exercise or a balanced diet. Long-term physical wellness depends on several lifestyle factors working together.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
